flowchart TD
    P1[Phase 1: Subject-Wise Stratified] --> P1a[Months 1-2]
    P1a --> P1b[Solve PYQs by topic while learning]
    P1b --> P1c[80% accuracy target per subtopic]

    P2[Phase 2: Timeline-Wise, Topic Mixed] --> P2a[Months 3-4]
    P2a --> P2b[Chapter-wise PYQs in decreasing order]
    P2b --> P2c[Tag questions as Easy/Medium/Hard]

    P3[Phase 3: Full-Length Mixed] --> P3a[Month 5+]
    P3a --> P3b[Complete papers in exam conditions]
    P3b --> P3c[60-min mistake analysis after each]
    P3c --> P3d[Identify weak topics to revisit]

    P1c --> P2
    P2c --> P3
